yle=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">○접수방법 :</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.7pt\">홈페이지</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">(http://gdec.kumoh.ac.kr) 로그인 후 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.7pt\">접수(교육개강전까지) , </span></font><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.7pt\">개설전 개폐강여부, 교재비 홈페이지 공지<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">○<strong>학습</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">비</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; COLOR: #cc0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt\">무료</span></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"><font size=\"2\">(단, 교재비 자부담)<br></font></span><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">○장&nbsp; 소 : 금오공과대학교 이오스관(차후 공지)&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">○유의사항 :&nbsp; 수강신청후 사전연락없이 취소 또는 개강후 무단결석자는 </span></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"><font size=\"2\">차기 개설강좌 신청 불이익있음&nbsp;<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"><font size=\"2\">○전&nbsp; 화 : 054-478-7241</font>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 21.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -21.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -2.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 금 오 공 과 대 학 교</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -2.4pt\">구미디지털산업지원교육센터장</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
